        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"4609e9f5-070e-4244-87c0-2fdf1a6fa885\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify me salvó de la mrt, es lo mejor que me ha pasado en la vida, nada como escuchar música cuando estás triste, contento, enojado, etc. Spotify es lo mejor del mundo, es una terapia que cuesta $115 al mes. 😻\"},{\"review_id\":\"edce5d2d-e41b-4ce9-90ed-80d3b702d4fc\",\"review_text\":\"Music is best\"},{\"review_id\":\"b985aad4-565e-484e-8aed-f587f02ef1a4\",\"review_text\":\"Awesome experience with so many ads😅\"},{\"review_id\":\"245071c4-61db-42b4-a524-052d520efdc4\",\"review_text\":\"Fully enjoyed\"},{\"review_id\":\"41f20b56-1b63-417b-81e2-4c77da1fa91a\",\"review_text\":\"Bycot Sweden😡🤬\"},{\"review_id\":\"4d0b8d08-226d-4f20-8be1-b7a1ba42bd4a\",\"review_text\":\"Because\"},{\"review_id\":\"f29d8263-24c5-45ea-a6eb-8cc43976627a\",\"review_text\":\"Super aap ❣️\"},{\"review_id\":\"643f6d2e-7fd6-43da-8b9a-b8bf5c0be519\",\"review_text\":\"Thank you and God 🙏 Bless You'll for creating this App.🙏😇🐾🐕🏡❤️😇🙏\"},{\"review_id\":\"95586621-012d-4696-8a18-4a6425c83479\",\"review_text\":\"The worst update of lifetime\"},{\"review_id\":\"a2926330-2f8c-492e-9853-c27d641805dd\",\"review_text\":\"Uninstalled..... You poor begger app\"}]}"
